This implies that $ \min_{\u \in \calU} \phi(\u) + \rho \norm{\u} \leq f(\x) + \rho \norm{\A\x - \b} $ $\forall~ x\in X \cap \Hu,\,\forall~\u \in U$ which yields that $ \min_{\u \in \calU} \phi(\u) + \rho \norm{\u} \leq f(\x) + \rho \norm{\A\x - \b} $ $\forall~ \x \in X $. This implies,
